2011 ... \",\"title\":\"https://lithub.com/20-writers-from-around-the-world-on-the-olympics/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d53\"},\"ref\":\"d53\",\"snippet\":\" ... In 2015, Mabanckou was a finalist for the Man Booker International Prize.\\n\\nThe Refugees by Viet Thanh Nguyen\\n\\nViet Thanh Nguyen's novel The Sympathizer is a New York Times best seller and won the Pulitzer Prize for Fiction. Other honors include the Dayton Literary Peace Prize, the ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.aspeninstitute.org/blog-posts/20-new-works-fiction-social-impact/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d24\"},\"ref\":\"d24\",\"snippet\":\" ... The APAALs honor books about Asian/Pacific Americans, their history and culture. Categories have included fiction and non-fiction for adults, picture/illustrated books, and children's/young-adult literature.\\n\\nThe Aspen Words Literary Prize is a $35,000 annual award for an influential work of fiction that ... \",\"title\":\"https://americanwritersmuseum.org/literary-links/literary-awards/?srsltid=AfmBOooYIGTV-EUbGd9xDLmBUtcV_Ts9VM7oqhh4K0lfwTLcUoKmITFg\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"066fa16c1e6310d352c42ed414761691fb79882bc32c6580d52dab9fe20aba5b\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"8da26e7cad8ff1378c6254546a3bd989b87c5f30e5844e8d4e0ab4d9bc818600\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Man Asian Literary Prize Wikipedia\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d26\"},\"ref\":\"d2