ry. In 1993, the \\\"Booker of Bookers\\\" prize was awarded to Salman Rushdie for Midnight's Children (the 1981 winner) as the best novel to win the award in its first 25 years ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_winners_and_nominated_authors_of_the_Booker_Prize\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d66\"},\"ref\":\"d66\",\"snippet\":\" ... treehouse, at the Jan Michalski Foundation. That's literally the ideal for most people, I would think. Anything that has a little bit of access to nature so that you can take a walk when you need a break.\\n\\nYou're married to another translator, right? The dynamic ... \",\"title\":\"https://thecreativeindependent.com/people/author-and-translator-jennifer-croft-on-challenging-preconceived-notions/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"5846be5d07374a72362c020bae06451a50840ae7fbfbbee8becb9186448c54f2\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"081d6d6fdd8363e700ec8d3d01ad4435f36cfba7e131a5c1ec0db9ed32f80618\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Jan Michalski Prize shortlist translated 25 languages\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_c5bde356fb014eaebe3c6ebc"},{"content":"Let me reconsider the puzzle. The award was \"originally created in the 2000s.\" Let me think about the Man Asian Literary Prize (2007) and its winners in the 2010s. Let me search for the Wikipedia page directly.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Man Asian Literary Prize Wikipedia winners shortlist\", \"Man Asian Literary Prize 2010 2011 2012 2013 2014 winner\", \"Man Asian Literary Prize established 2007 best novel Asian writer\"], \"top_k\": 10}","name":"search"},"id":"call_f1f0219c1c2f4add97c